# Tool versions pinned via asdf or mise.
#
# To install all listed tools:
#   asdf install        # if using asdf
#   mise install        # if using mise
#
# This project compiles with maven.compiler.release=21, so we pin
# Java 21 here.  Eclipse Temurin is widely available via both mise
# and asdf for Java >= 11; any 21.x Temurin (or a compatible OpenJDK
# build like Corretto 21 / Zulu 21) will work.
#
# Runtime requirements are looser: the swingwebview dependency itself
# targets Java 8 bytecode, so the produced jar runs on JDK 8 and any
# newer LTS.  Only the build needs Java 21.
#
# Native WebView runtime dependencies are NOT managed via asdf/mise
# and must be installed with your OS package manager:
#
#   Linux:    libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 (or libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
#             on older distros), libxt6
#   macOS:    no extra install; the system WKWebView is used
#   Windows:  Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime (bundled with Windows 11
#             and recent Edge; on older Windows install the Evergreen
#             runtime from
#             https://developer.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/)
#
java temurin-21.0.5+11.0.LTS
maven 3.9.9
